! ============================================================
! District_34Bus_3Zone LoadShape Definitions
! 24h / 96-point / 15-min resolution (sinterval=900)
! ============================================================
! NOTE: All loadshape data are inline (no external CSV dependency).
!       Mult values are per-unit multipliers on the base kW/kVAR.
!       PV irradiance mult = 0 during nighttime, bell-shaped daytime.
!       EV charging mult peaks during evening hours (18:00-22:00).
!       Load curve follows typical residential/commercial dual-peak pattern.
! ============================================================

! ----------------------------------------------------------
! 1. Default Load Curve (Residential/Commercial Dual-Peak)
!    Peaks at ~08:00 (morning) and ~19:00 (evening)
!    Valley at ~03:00-05:00
! ----------------------------------------------------------
